emergefzf - TUI Package Manager for Gentoo Linux
================================================

Requirements
------------
- fzf (app-shells/fzf)
- equery (app-portage/gentoolkit)
- portage and POSIX shell and utilities

Usage
-----
run

    emergefzf

The script will automatically set up a post-sync hook
for caching available packages.

After the setup, you can
Fuzzy-find, preview data and select a package (or multiple)
and view their metadata, pretend or install them.
